Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Comfy, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Release me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,From where I'm standing, it looks like\Nyou're in no position to be making demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already destroyed\None of your cohorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.53,0:01:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have the Millennium\NRing to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's painful, isn't it, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To lose someone you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try losing your whole village!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, if you'll just let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my homeland, took away\Nmy family, and left me with nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to pay\Nthe price by serving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you have a dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It just needs to be brought out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm just the man to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Puzzle is\Nsensing a dark presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A village along the Nile was\Nattacked a few moments ago. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, one of our sanctuaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But whose are Gnardins?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person capable\Nof an act of treason like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let him get away, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround the palace at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let no stone in the courtyard go unturned!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.71,0:02:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,must be... stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just been under incredible strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot let that rogue continue to\Nget away with these despicable acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us take him down once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taken the captain's horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt in the name of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Interfere and face the wrath of Diabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the mighty pharaoh has taken my fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This madness ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods of Egypt, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems we have\Nan unexpected guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate battle for the future\Nof mankind shall begin once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Only this time, I shall prevail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running like a coward and\Nface up to what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is a big red dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This sort of thing used to\Nsurprise me, but now, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone get a good look\Nat who he was chasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The car!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! We gotta help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all of your secrets are none.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you did at Kal Elna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,These events may have\Noccurred 15 long years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but time doesn't heal all wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh, we've lost our\Nstronghold to the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and the enemy continues their\Nmarch towards the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,With our remaining armies, how\Nlong can we withstand their attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If all goes well, perhaps a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So the end has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, giving\Nup is not an option, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.89,0:05:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This conflict will not just\Ndecide the fate of our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but that of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to allow the enemy\Nto advance much further,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they would seize our Millennium Spellbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They must not succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that whomever deciphers\Nthe book's ancient text will be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,able to control a power known only\Nby the Egyptian gods themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and perhaps we can tap\Nthat power to defeat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been through this before, Aknaden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has been able\Nto decode those spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We have had a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that\Nyou've decoded the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, but I have managed\Nto decipher one of its spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ritual of sorts, allowing the\Nspellcaster to forge seven mystical treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,These Millennium Items could eliminate the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,invaders and bring tranquility\Nto Egypt once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And just how long will\Nit take to create them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the spell, the task\Nwill take seven days. Fortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already begun experimenting with the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow magic necessary\Nto fashion these items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If it will bring peace, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:07:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forth and create these seven\Nmillennium items in the name of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of this kingdom\Nrests with you, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Make our father proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to save our kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I must do the unthinkable, and\Nif my actions are discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,people may seek revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, for your own protection, no\None must ever know I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You must run as far from here as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish there was another solution to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And please remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.69,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it is essential that Seto never learn the\Ntruth about who I am, as long as he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm nodding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my love, and my dear son, Sidhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've called you here today for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Pharaoh's strongest soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the very future of\Nour land depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never repeat what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I shall make sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my voice penetrate your very core!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master, are none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, my voice is\Nthe voice of reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the voice of peace, the\Nonly voice you will obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been handpicked to take part in a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,ritualistic experiment to\Nsave the land of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission begins tonight in a small\Nvillage on the outskirts of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To Kal Elna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,To Kal Elna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh must never learn of the\Nevents that are about to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the Book of Spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,evil spirits must be captured in order\Nto create the Seven Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of this, my brother would never approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We stand before the evil\Nvillage of Kal-El-Na.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The inhabitants are possessed with\Nthe darkest spirits known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they have been raiding our royal\Ntombs and stealing our riches for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But tonight we shall put\Nan end to their evil ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture those spirits, men! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits are lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Relinquish your evil spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave our village at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to put your souls to good use!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits of darkness, I command thee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:10:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Offer up your power, your very essence,\Nso that the Millennium Items may be born!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not from gold that\Nthese treasures are forged,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but from the darkness that\Nlies within the hearts of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.73,0:10:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked! Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Items!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Akkadon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.33,0:10:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we've angered the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks as if the seven\Nitems fit inside that stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I unleashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Return those treasures\Nto their resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These items belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow creature, unhack me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Anubis, we must leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not without this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the king of Egypt has given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They all ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, those cowards have\Nabandoned their kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,which means that Egypt belongs to us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.89,0:12:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these poor fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They face us with an army of seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of Egypt,\NMillennium Items activate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mighty spirits, protect our kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall never forget that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was both my greatest\Nachievement and my darkest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My efforts had saved Egypt from destruction,\Nbut I deserted my family to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And my only son, Seto, would\Nnever know of his noble ancestry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of King Aknam Cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,let us welcome the new guardian of\Nthe Millennium Rod, Master Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Though raised by peasants,\Nhe has risen to excellence,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,passing his tests with the\Nhighest scores we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my sacred court.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks for this great honor, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll serve thee well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forth, I\Nam your humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As the youngest royal guardian, you\Nwill sit at the right hand of my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the future king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been unusually quiet, Aknaden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There, kneeling before the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,unbeknownst to anyone in\Nthe room, was my own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy I abandoned and\Nstripped of his royal heritage
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,had now overcome every obstacle\Nand risen to greatness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All on his own merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I realized it\Nis you who should be Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My son deserves to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,King he shall become!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time we\Nshowed off your newest ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusionary Shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearbound steals the abilities\Nof the enemies it defeats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That last attack came courtesy of Mahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sliver, lightning, blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.25,0:15:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Farrow, but you're\Nnot in the clear just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten who you're dealing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And you seem to have\Nforgotten that this battle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't one of your little card tournaments,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you're about to find out,\Nin this arena I have the advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Diomalt, destroy the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing? One thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way for his majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is between you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue to fight me or save your people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that red monster just saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, protect these villagers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How noble of you to use your monster\Nas a shield to save these fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But how much abuse can Slifer endure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a dead end, pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for rescuing those\Nprecious villagers of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No harm shall befall the\Npeople of my kingdom, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, those are definitely not holograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you put this\Ncity in any more danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sliver, take this fight to the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My people are safe from your attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian god may control the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.60,0:17:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My Diabaunt commands the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,making him infinitely more\Npowerful than your dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My creature has the ability to move\Nin shadow, completely undetectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the time it reveals\Nitself, it shall be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bond with the gods is so strong\Nthat when they feel pain, so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how shall I conclude\Nthis battle of ours, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I destroy your Slifer or this city?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I'll have Dearbound crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there is a simpler way to spare\Nyourself and your city from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.15,0:18:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just surrender your\NMillennium Puzzle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, I promise to leave you\Nand your precious villagers alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hand over the Millennium Puzzle,\NMakuro will become unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.95,0:18:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't let him harm my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A wise decision, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can distract him for long\Nenough, I may be able to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get off your high\Nhorse and kneel before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Slifer, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, call off your dealbound\Nand I shall call off my Egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can play at this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is quite an\Ninteresting predicament, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a draw, but\Nlooks can be deceiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabam, destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Seto's creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparrow, we shall save thee!
